  "text": "How to send automated polite payment reminders at three days, seven days, and fourteen days. Remembering which client owes what balance turns into a frustrating administrative headache after work hours. Irregular follow-ups make your consulting business look disorganized, giving clients an excuse to stall payments. Use QuickBooks Online automated workflows or Zapier to dispatch scheduled reminders with embedded payment links. Your consulting fees arrive on time without awkward conversations.",
